Third-party components
----------------------

The project downloads, patches or builds the following components but does not
redistribute their sources:

* mini-commander — https://github.com/Tomas-M/mini-commander
  License: GNU General Public License v3.0.
  The ToaruOS port is carried by mc-toaru/patches/mc-toaru.patch, which is
  distributed under the same license.

* TinyCC — https://bellard.org/tcc/ , https://repo.or.cz/tinycc.git
  License: GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1.
  The ToaruOS target support is carried by tcc/toaru/tcc-toaru.patch, which is
  distributed under the same license.

* ToaruOS 2.3.2 — https://github.com/klange/toaruos
  License: BSD-2-Clause.
  The release ISO and the sources are downloaded by tests/run-toaru.sh; they
  are not part of this repository.

* Nuklear — https://github.com/Immediate-Mode-UI/Nuklear
  License: public domain / MIT.
  The single header is downloaded by tests/run-toaru.sh; it is not part of
  this repository.
